{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement", "comment_count": 20, "fallback_count": 0, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报15800了，这算不算变相营销？等正式发布再看吧。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "儿童车卖15800确实贵，但考虑到华为智选和赛力斯的技术，可能包含智能功能，成本高。理性看待，等配置公布。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候骑的几十块小三轮，现在孩子真幸福，但这么贵真的有必要吗？", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "15800的儿童车，不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌，这波操作666。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，容易养成攀比心理，家长应该理性消费，别被营销带偏。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格直接劝退，本来想给孩子买个玩具，结果比真车还贵，还是等降价吧。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，15800确实罕见，但如果是限量版或高科技，可能合理。等官方配置。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "前排吃瓜，看这价格能不能成为年度最贵玩具，坐等官方打脸。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "这价格背后反映的是消费主义陷阱，连儿童玩具都开始高端化，社会价值观堪忧。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，质量肯定有保障，价格高也正常，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报15800了，这算不算价格欺诈？等正式发布再看吧。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "从成本看，儿童车用料和设计可能确实高端，但15800的定价需要市场验证。建议理性看待，等官方配置公布。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候爸妈给我买玩具车，几十块就能开心很久。现在孩子玩的车都这么贵，普通家庭怎么承受？", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "15800？不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌，孩子坐里面更安全，哈哈。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，是炫富还是真爱？价值观扭曲，应该引导孩子正确消费观。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买辆好点的儿童车，但15800确实超预算。希望官方能给出合理定价，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，15800确实罕见。但问界M9本身售价50万+，儿童车复刻其设计，成本可能不低。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸，这价格要是真的，估计又是一波韭菜收割。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映社会消费分层加剧，可能加剧攀比心理，不利于儿童成长环境。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障，价格高可能因为技术含量高。支持国货，期待正式发布。", "pro